= The Queen of Naboo Addresses the Senate

Queen Amidala has reached Coruscant and pleads with the Senate for help. The Trade Federation's delegate denies everything and demands a commission to "investigate the accusations". Chancellor Valorum, bound by procedure, allows the motion.

Senator Palpatine leans close to his Queen. "Enough is enough," he murmurs. "The Senate needs a strong Chancellor." Moments later, Amidala moves a **vote of no confidence** in Valorum.

The Caucus must decide in the next few minutes.

- @yes: Support the vote of no confidence.
- @no: Stand by Valorum and propose an emergency relief fleet for Naboo.
- @abstain: Abstain.

@yes
subtitle: Valorum is paralysed. Perhaps someone better can lead.
on-arrival: vonc_rc = 1; mod_relation -= 6; pal_relation += 6; rc_momentum += 0.5
go-to: a1_vonc

@no
subtitle: −1 political capital. A real answer to Naboo might save Valorum.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: vonc_rc = 0; capital -= 1; relief_fleet = 1; mod_relation += 8; pal_relation -= 4; judicial_forces += 0.3
go-to: a1_vonc

@abstain
subtitle: Let others decide Valorum's fate.
on-arrival: vonc_rc = 0.5
go-to: a1_vonc
